                                "sense_id": "f159b0e7-8e25-32b8-9348-854413718c4b",
                                "text": "Nowhere was the victory of Linnaeanism more complete than in Britain. When William Hudson's Flora Anglica, organized in the Linnaean manner, appeared in 1762, it displaced all previous floras."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
